# NOTE: bun.lock is intentionally committed. Pinning dependency versions keeps
# builds reproducible across machines and CI: an unpinned install pulled
# @fortawesome/fontawesome-free 7.3.1, which no longer ships the webfonts
# directory that main.go's go:embed directive requires.
